{"Title":"An Act amending the charter of the town of Marshfield to make references to the board of selectmen gender neutral","BillNumber":"S2715","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"PMO","Name":"Patrick M. O'Connor","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMO","ResponseDate":"2024-03-26T15:44:03.84"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"PMO","Name":"Patrick M. O'Connor","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMO","ResponseDate":"2024-03-26T15:44:03.8533333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2715/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"Senate, April 8, 2024 - New draft (Senator O'Connor) to Senate Bill amending the charter of the town of Marshfield (Senate, No. 1317).","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 1-2 of the charter of the town of Marshfield, which is on file in the office of the archivist of the commonwealth as provided in section 12 of chapter 43B of the General Laws, is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board. \r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 2-4 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “Board of Selectmen”, each time they appear, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 3. Section 3-1 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 4. Subsection 3-2-1 of section 3-2 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the caption and inserting in place thereof the following caption:-  Select Board.\r\n\tSECTION 5. Said section 3-2 of said charter is hereby further amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen”, each time they appear, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 6. Said section 3-2 of said charter is hereby further amended by striking out the words “Board of Selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 7. Said section 3-2 of said charter is hereby further amended by striking out the word “selectmen”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 8. Said section 3-2 of said charter is further hereby amended by striking out the word “Selectmen”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\t\r\n\tSECTION 9. Subsection 4-1-1 of section 4-1 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “Board of Selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 10. Said subsection 4-1-1 of said section 4-1 of said charter is hereby further amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:-select board.\t\r\n\tSECTION 11. Said subsection 4-1-1 of said section 4-1 of said charter is hereby further amended by striking out the word “selectmen’s” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board’s.\r\n\tSECTION 12. Said subsection 4-1-1 of said section 4-1 of said charter is hereby further amended by striking out the word “selectmen”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\t \r\n\tSECTION 13. Subsection section 4-1-2 of said section 4-1 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “Board of Selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 14. Subsection 4-1-3 of said section 4-1 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “Board of Selectmen”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 15. Said subsection 4-1-3 of said section 4-1 of said charter is hereby further amended by striking out the word “Selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\t\r\n\tSECTION 16. Subsection 4-1-4 of said section 4-1 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “Board of Selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 17. Section 5-2 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the word “selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\t\r\n\tSECTION 18. Section 5-3 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the word “selectmen”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 19. Section 5-4 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the word “selectmen”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 20. Section 5-5 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 21. Section 5-7 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the word “Selectmen”, the first time it appears, and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 22. Said section 5-7 of said charter is hereby further amended by striking out the word “Selectmen”, the second time it appears, and inserting in place thereof the following words:- the select board.\r\n\tSECTION 23. Subsection 8-1-2 of section 8-1 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the word “selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 24.  Subsection 8-1-3 of said section 8-1 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the word “Selectmen’s” and inserting in place thereof the following words:-  select board’s.\r\n\tSECTION 25. Said subsection 8-1-3 of said section 8-1 of said charter is hereby further amended by striking out the word “selectmen”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 26. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"S2715","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2715/Branches/House/Amendments/1/"}]}